    "rationale": "Audit found weak spectral values, duplicated missing indicators and thin-file errors. Test price_change,order_coherence,cross_capacity beyond exactly the same8 support/availability variables. Own-category prices remove category-level composition without a population reference; cross-category within-order covariance measures a different structure than category entropy or mean price. No SKU/quality information; estimates are finite-history proxies and raw price changes are not causal risk evidence. New inputs are linear with stronger shrinkage to avoid repeating the145-parameter spectral head; repeated development selection remains.",
